              "cardId": "c_30117_uni4",
              "note": {
                "en": ""
              }
            },
            {
              "cardId": "c_30117_uni4_lbk_mut1",
              "note": {
                "en": ""
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "prose",
          "body": {
            "en": "Brand Fracture/Agony, Rift Disperse, Shattering, Rapacity"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "prose",
          "body": {
            "en": "Olga's main gimmick is her 2 Brands, Fracture and Agony\nBrands are a buff that Olga applies to herself\nBrands trigger whenever Agony and or Fracture Activate\nActivations can be from Forced (Cards) or Naturally (Turn End)\nThe turn end Moved Rift/Disperse stays in hand beginning of the next turn\nBrand Fracture moves Disperse which Activates Agony\nBrand Agony moves Rift which Activates Fracture\nWhen Brands move a card they'll also be -1 Cost\nShattering is a Unique Debuff that End of the Line (EOTL) Applies\nEnemies with Shattering take 1.3/1.4x damage from DoTs\n(Enemies take DoT damage, then Shattering deals a% as Fixed)\nRapacity on EOTL and Reckoning\nCards with this Keyword turn the damage attribute into DoT"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "prose",
          "body": {
            "en": "Lets go over a couple examples\n2 Fracture Brand\n2 Agony Brand\nRift -> Disperse -> Rift -> Disperse -> Rift or\nDisperse -> Rift -> Disperse -> Rift -> Disperse\nNow lets change up the timing of when you apply the Brands\nDraw Rift & Disperse\nRift/Disperse\n2 Fracture Brand\n2 Agony Brand\nRift/Disperse -> Chain move x4"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
